# Live confirmation of B3 (error-response hygiene) and the undefined-route/500 observation.
# Collected 2026-09-14 by curl against the public testnet RPC endpoint.

$ curl -s -o /dev/null -w "HTTP %{http_code}\n" https://rpc.testnet.sundialprotocol.com/this-path-does-not-exist-evidence-check
HTTP 500
$ curl -s https://rpc.testnet.sundialprotocol.com/this-path-does-not-exist-evidence-check
{"error":"Something went wrong"}

$ curl -s -o /dev/null -w "HTTP %{http_code}\n" https://rpc.testnet.sundialprotocol.com/health/ready
HTTP 200
$ curl -s https://rpc.testnet.sundialprotocol.com/health/ready
{"status":"ready"}
